#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:4 87e236dcd5174b2c9904624e82083035
msgid "申报成果获取积分"
msgstr "Earn Points by Reporting Achievements"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:7 2850b70fe5584d058b78ef77e531fc00
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Goal"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:9 46216761ed36446c9c89effb1177c42d
msgid ""
"帮助用户了解积分的来源——积分不是账户余额，而是用户在使用平台过程中取 得的**科研成果**经管理员审批后获得的奖励。本节重点介绍如何申报成果。"
msgstr ""
"Help users understand how points are earned--points are not account balance "
"but rewards for **research achievements** obtained on the platform and "
"approved by administrators. This section focuses on how to report "
"achievements."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:13 efdc3f66c4694042850eb46d6ceb6c62
msgid "进入方式"
msgstr "How to Access"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:15 c59561710c254b269cdfcd9b565f1db3
msgid "点击左侧菜单 ``积分管理``，进入积分页面。"
msgstr "Click ``Points Management`` in the left menu to open the points page."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:18 80d6ba204d4b440d8f79c270ee6823e4
msgid "积分与余额的区别"
msgstr "Points vs. Account Balance"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:22 9f9f578f718a4c3bb432d4f8081da829
msgid "**积分** 和 **账户余额** 是两个不同概念："
msgstr "**Points** and **account balance** are different concepts:"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:24 f02dc7a7fe8e4effb1e317aca03cd75a
msgid "账户余额（工作台 ``账户概览`` 中的 ``用户余额``\\ ）：是用户 充值/扣费的金额，单位是「元」，与计费相关。"
msgstr ""
"Account balance (``User Balance`` in ``Account Overview`` on the workbench):"
" amount credited or charged, in yuan (CNY), related to billing."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:26 807b855fa42048d4bdb4e681003c7f85
msgid "积分：是用户申报成果（如论文、专利、报告）并经管理员审批通 过后获得的奖励，单位是「积分」，可在 ``服务兑换`` 中兑换计算服 务。"
msgstr ""
"Points: rewards after reporting achievements (papers, patents, reports, "
"etc.) and administrator approval, measured in points, redeemable for compute"
" services in ``Service Redemption``."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:30 715fb39bd49849e2abd3f78a3c8a3d2d
msgid "本节只介绍**积分**及其获取流程。账户余额相关问题请参考计费相关章 节或联系管理员。"
msgstr ""
"This section covers **points** and how to earn them only. For account "
"balance, see billing chapters or contact an administrator."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:34 122c3d02e2dc4bd38c050e7191e13f2c
msgid "页面内容"
msgstr "Page Contents"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:36 605eb199474241059ccb1d048204d418
msgid "积分页面包含四个标签页："
msgstr "The points page has four tabs:"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:38 57c616da778941b4beafeda6a860e0ed
msgid "``积分概览``：显示 ``可用积分``、``冻结积分``、``累计获得``、 ``累计消耗`` 四个数值。"
msgstr ""
"``Points Overview``: shows ``Available Points``, ``Frozen Points``, ``Total "
"Earned``, and ``Total Spent``."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:40 4c3a49c5e61a4d0da7dcc24990adbef3
msgid "``积分流水``：积分变动明细。"
msgstr "``Points History``: point transaction details."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:41 049708fa21eb47c8a328c02a3e217ec2
msgid "``服务兑换``：用积分兑换计算服务（具体兑换规则由平台管理员发布）。"
msgstr ""
"``Service Redemption``: redeem points for compute services (rules published "
"by platform administrators)."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:42 39d8b57d7cec4ecc93aa4fc9f93ad7a9
msgid "``成果申报``：**最重要的标签**，用户在此提交科研成果。"
msgstr ""
"``Achievement Reporting``: **the most important tab**, where users submit "
"research achievements."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:48 d83fea36009547b894ea9346990cd4f3
msgid "积分概览"
msgstr "Points Overview"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:48 107c0aca5eb64fc8aee9ecad943f493b
msgid "积分概览页面，显示可用积分、冻结积分、累计获得、累计消耗。"
msgstr ""
"Points overview page showing available, frozen, total earned, and total "
"spent points."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:51 aaa1879722cd4c6f986f551b94d9cab8
msgid "成果申报流程"
msgstr "Achievement Reporting Workflow"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:53 c83132cbb65d40fa93703beaa53ade51
msgid ""
"成果申报是普通用户获得积分的主要途径。流程是：在 ``成果申报`` 标签下 点击 ``新增成果`` → 填写成果信息 → 提交 → 等待管理员审核 → "
"审核通 过后积分自动到账。"
msgstr ""
"Reporting achievements is the main way regular users earn points. Workflow: "
"under ``Achievement Reporting``, click ``Add Achievement`` -> fill in "
"details -> submit -> wait for administrator review -> points are credited "
"automatically after approval."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:57 2bbf644192f1491f9143ed012579e2c1
msgid "在积分页面顶部点击 ``成果申报`` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"At the top of the points page, click the ``Achievement Reporting`` tab."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:58 80084116fc94403f8f71aad05369e782
msgid "在子标签栏点击 ``新增成果``。"
msgstr "In the sub-tab bar, click ``Add Achievement``."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:59 b7aacdd627244fd48f12631c7a1d9286
msgid "填写 ``成果名称`` （必填，例如：基于 SKA 数据的脉冲星搜寻）。"
msgstr ""
"Fill in ``Achievement Name`` (required, e.g. pulsar search based on SKA "
"data)."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:60 1dcba27e88314c88a1b8293edab42089
msgid "选择 ``成果类型`` （必填，例如：论文、专利、技术报告等， 以页面下拉项为准）。"
msgstr ""
"Select ``Achievement Type`` (required, e.g. paper, patent, technical report"
"--as shown in the drop-down)."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:62 a460a5db579a4c5bb5c7c654fb37809f
msgid "在 ``成果描述`` 中详细描述成果内容（必填），建议包括："
msgstr ""
"Describe the achievement in ``Achievement Description`` (required). "
"Suggested content:"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:64 527eacca9fef4e28be67d6b5e551d0f4
msgid "研究背景与目标。"
msgstr "Research background and objectives."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:65 dbc679d22645428bacfdccff77d1b1c3
msgid "使用了平台的哪些资源（如 CPU 核数、运行时长）。"
msgstr "Which platform resources were used (e.g. CPU cores, runtime)."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:66 8408b1c6f745400d957d5de587f5bc67
msgid "成果形式（已发表论文、已授权专利、内部报告等）。"
msgstr ""
"Form of the achievement (published paper, granted patent, internal report, "
"etc.)."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:67 9e59b4c6c52c4882b4ed57c193125139
msgid "关联的项目组或作业 ID（可选）。"
msgstr "Associated project group or job ID (optional)."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:69 3f0fb217b065425fad131f738f68c5fd
msgid "如有相关附件（论文 PDF、报告、图表等），点击 ``上传附件`` 选择 本地文件上传。"
msgstr ""
"For attachments (PDF, report, figures, etc.), click ``Upload Attachment`` "
"and select local files."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:71 233a2091ed794027aaa9c09bd38f0a30
msgid "填写完成后，点击 ``提交审核`` 按钮提交；如暂时不提交可点击 ``保存草稿``；如放弃可点击 ``取 消``。"
msgstr ""
"When done, click ``Submit for Review``; click ``Save Draft`` to save without"
" submitting; click ``Cancel`` to discard."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:73 56e4ecbc4f87428081c3c85857be1c45
msgid "看到成功提示后，切到 ``我的成果`` 标签可查看刚刚提交的成果。"
msgstr ""
"After a success message, switch to ``My Achievements`` to view the "
"submission."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:79 3d641a25c2bf41c7917853e3744871a8
msgid "新增成果表单"
msgstr "Add Achievement Form"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:79 23b518b08af947139ce7444bb32aeb18
msgid "新增成果表单，填写成果名称、类型、描述并上传附件后提交审核。"
msgstr ""
"Add Achievement form: fill name, type, description, upload attachments, and "
"submit for review."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:82 5a3bc996661c41a9b664f003d1436434
msgid "查看我的成果与审核状态"
msgstr "View My Achievements and Review Status"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:84 5a62795a2adb4f369a9dd1ca6536fd4d
msgid "在 ``成果申报`` 标签下点击 ``我的成果`` 子标签。"
msgstr ""
"Under ``Achievement Reporting``, click the ``My Achievements`` sub-tab."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:85 6648deea6e374339b142d9ee921653a7
msgid ""
"列表显示已提交的所有成果，列包含 ``成果名称``、``类型``、 ``积分``、``状态``、``创建时间``、``附件``、``操作``。"
msgstr ""
"The list shows all submitted achievements with columns ``Achievement Name``,"
" ``Type``, ``Points``, ``Status``, ``Created Time``, ``Attachments``, and "
"``Actions``."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:87 30eb23b57dba4bc290bade7d82e01f52
msgid "列表上方 ``状态`` 下拉框可按状态筛选。"
msgstr "Use the ``Status`` drop-down above the list to filter by status."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:88 a3881095dbf540dba67aa378bc174b5b
msgid "点击 ``审核状态`` 子标签可看到各状态对应的说明。"
msgstr "Click the ``Review Status`` sub-tab for descriptions of each status."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:89 1e8beb5d30ea47ab9a1c4a449608efb5
msgid "列表右上角的 ``新增成果`` 按钮可快速再次提交。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``Add Achievement`` at the top right of the list to submit again "
"quickly."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:95 20c2eaea630e4fd2bef6f0f167458829
msgid "我的成果列表"
msgstr "My Achievements List"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:95 2751fe1e2464431288e155ad673d7125
msgid "我的成果列表，列出已提交的所有成果及其审核状态。"
msgstr "My Achievements list showing all submissions and their review status."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:98 430053c4b5bd4396abe0a369989ebd64
msgid "审核状态说明"
msgstr "Review Status Descriptions"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:100 55e23234046f4ef7a8296827b0bd36bd
msgid "``待审核``：成果已提交，等待管理员审核。"
msgstr "``Pending Review``: submitted, awaiting administrator review."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:101 dda91902adf54f059b8835828c56bc68
msgid "``已通过``：成果通过审核，相应积分已到账。"
msgstr "``Approved``: passed review; corresponding points have been credited."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:102 e9ead27c0fb940658523eefb46847980
msgid "``已驳回``：成果未通过审核，可在备注中查看原因后重新提交。"
msgstr ""
"``Rejected``: not approved; see remarks for the reason and resubmit if "
"needed."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:103 483f62e56d33432e839a24b99d2ae746
msgid "``已撤回``：用户主动撤回的成果。"
msgstr "``Withdrawn``: achievement withdrawn by the user."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:106 b33fed4d98664fada035515e3987e023
msgid "查看积分流水"
msgstr "View Points History"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:108 fe75ba6a509b40268b547eaa861b3051
msgid "在积分页面点击 ``积分流水`` 标签。"
msgstr "On the points page, click the ``Points History`` tab."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:109 10bcbece1e6e4f18824e2c1ffa8bb7c3
msgid "页面展示积分变动明细列表。"
msgstr "The page shows a list of point transactions."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:110 574fd713ff73439dab914317b7e39514
msgid "每条记录包含时间、类型（获得 / 消耗 / 冻结 / 解冻 / 调整）和说明。"
msgstr ""
"Each record includes time, type (earned / spent / frozen / unfrozen / "
"adjusted), and description."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:116 d90966f535c94637bab9ce2d9b464484
msgid "积分流水"
msgstr "Points History"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:116 0e5d6d2b65b840d69715f59ed44a087e
msgid "积分流水标签页，展示积分变动记录。"
msgstr "Points History tab showing point transaction records."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:119 c08ca740cc104645b9a7856612939b7f
msgid "注意事项"
msgstr "Notes"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:123 c968f2c78fb24548bd138a1d0bbb7786
msgid "同一成果请勿重复提交，避免被系统识别为重复并驳回。"
msgstr ""
"Do not submit the same achievement twice to avoid duplicate detection and "
"rejection."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:124 5d15965b544549de9367bf085745d7a6
msgid "管理员审核完成后，积分会直接到账并显示在 ``积分概览`` 的 ``可用 积分`` 中。审核进度可在 ``我的成果`` 列表中查看。"
msgstr ""
"After administrator approval, points are credited and shown under "
"``Available Points`` in ``Points Overview``. Track progress in ``My "
"Achievements``."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:126 f17407a6a76545b8b425e4bd77be3e46
msgid "积分记录或状态异常时，请通过 ``工单管理`` 提交工单联系管理员。 本手册不介绍管理员审批、调整等操作。"
msgstr ""
"If point records or status look wrong, submit a ticket via ``Ticket "
"Management``. This manual does not cover administrator approval or "
"adjustment operations."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:130 8524e52c4a024428ba168e71c1046637
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Frequently Asked Questions"

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:132 c4a6280c40dd4a5d9bf8fd5e77c46f2d
msgid "**积分怎么获得？** 通过 ``积分管理`` → ``成果申报`` → ``新增成果`` 提交科研成果，管 理员审核通过后积分自动到账。"
msgstr ""
"**How do I earn points?** Go to ``Points Management`` -> ``Achievement "
"Reporting`` -> ``Add Achievement`` to submit research achievements; points "
"are credited after administrator approval."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:136 6f36e3b7544f4826a58b6c700d7edbc9
msgid "**积分可以用来做什么？** 可在 ``服务兑换`` 标签中兑换平台提供的计算服务（具体兑换规则由管 理员发布）。"
msgstr ""
"**What can points be used for?** Redeem compute services on the ``Service "
"Redemption`` tab (rules published by administrators)."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:140 57e781207ddd4062b7ae24e44099e740
msgid "**已提交的成果可以修改吗？** 提交后处于 ``待审核`` 状态的成果通常可在 ``操作`` 列编辑；已进入 审核流程的成果不可修改。"
msgstr ""
"**Can I edit a submitted achievement?** Items in ``Pending Review`` can "
"usually be edited from ``Actions``; items already in review cannot be "
"changed."

#: ../../docs/faq/points.rst:144 bc98a7c7052041e9965deeb01ad04da2
msgid "**积分记录异常怎么办？** 在 ``积分流水`` 中核对变动记录。如确认异常，提交工单联系管理员。"
msgstr ""
"**Abnormal point records?** Check transactions in ``Points History``. If "
"confirmed, submit a ticket to contact an administrator."
